{
  "version": "2.15",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "noteBrief",
      "x": 40,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 120,
      "content": "Host Agent · 网关配置窗（顶栏型）\n\n对照 docs/ui-design-system.md §3.3「标准配置窗」与 §4.1 A / §4.2。\n客户区 420 宽；顶栏 72；水平内边距 28；编辑高 28；主/次按钮 100×30。\n文案：Road Desk / 被控端网关配置；浏览…（勿用「选文件…」）。\n实现目标：src/agent/gateway_config.cpp — 与 Viewer 登录同源色板/字体/DPI。"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "lblDefault",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 48,
      "fill": "$rd.color.text.secondary",
      "content": "A · 首次配置（420×360）",
      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontWeight": "600"
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "dlgDefault",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 80,
      "name": "Agent Gateway / Default",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 360,
      "fill": "$rd.color.surface.app",
      "effect": {
        "type": "shadow",
        "shadowType": "outer",
        "color": "#161E2E22",
        "offset": { "x": 0, "y": 8 },
